exitPosition.tree
├── given contract is paused
│   └── it should revert with IsPaused
└── given contract is not paused
    ├── given reentrancy attempt
    │   └── it should revert with reentrancy guard
    └── given no reentrancy
        ├── given caller is not participant and not delegatee
        │   └── it should revert with NotAuthorized
        └── given caller is authorized (participant or delegatee)
            ├── given rescue mode is inactive
            │   ├── given position lock has not expired
            │   │   └── it should revert with LockNotExpired
            │   └── given position lock has expired
            │       ├── given position tapReleased is true
            │       │   └── it should return 0 and not transfer
            │       └── given position tapReleased is false
            │           ├── it should return tapAmount
            │           ├── it should set tapReleased to true
            │           ├── it should set tapAmount to 0
            │           ├── it should set expiry to 0
            │           ├── it should transfer TAP to recipient
            │           └── it should emit ExitPosition event
            └── given rescue mode is active
                ├── given position tapReleased is true
                │   └── it should return 0 and not transfer
                └── given position tapReleased is false
                    ├── it should return tapAmount
                    ├── it should set tapReleased to true
                    ├── it should set tapAmount to 0
                    ├── it should set expiry to 0
                    ├── it should transfer TAP to recipient
                    └── it should emit ExitPosition event
